         peony-desktop-clock-widget,
         peony-desktop-image-widget,
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: peony-device-rename, ukui-bluetooth
Description: Peony qt extensions
 Peony is the official file manager for the UKUI desktop. This
 package is a metapackage, which adds extended functionality to
 the Peony file manager.

Package: peony-intelligent-data-management-service
Architecture: any
Depends:${misc:Depends},${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Peony intelligent Spaces Service
 Peony is the official file manager for the UKUI desktop. This
 package is a service, which provide the intelligent ability for the peony spaces.

Package: peony-intelligent-plugin
Architecture: any
Depends:${misc:Depends},${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Peony intelligent Plugin
 The related plugins integrated into the intelligent data manager include the VFS plugin, custom view plugin, etc.

Package: peony-spaceview-plugin
Architecture: any
Depends:${misc:Depends},${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Peony space view Plugin
 The related plugins integrated into the intelligent data manager when the space file content is empty.

Package: peony-desktop-clock-widget
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Desktop clock widget for peony-qt-desktop
 This package provides a simple, resizable desktop clock widget for
 peony-qt-desktop. The widget follows the system time format and can
 be placed and resized like other desktop widgets.

Package: peony-desktop-image-widget
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Desktop image widget for peony-qt-desktop
 This package provides a desktop widget to open and display local
 images in peony-qt-desktop. It offers fixed-size variants and keeps
 rounded visual decoration consistent with desktop widgets.

Package: peony-quick-look-plugin
Architecture: any
Depends: libpeony3(>=3.26.0.0-0k1.1),
         libukui-previewhub1,
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Peony quick look plugin using ukui-previewhub
 Peony is the official file manager for the UKUI desktop. This package
 adds a quick look plugin that previews files with ukui-previewhub.

Package: peony-previewhub-hybrid-plugin
Architecture: any
Depends: libpeony3(>=3.26.0.0-0k1.1),
         libukui-previewhub1,
         ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Peony hybrid preview plugin using ukui-previewhub
 Peony is the official file manager for the UKUI desktop. This package
 adds a preview page plugin that uses Peony default preview for folders
 and generic files, and ukui-previewhub for text, images, audio, video,
 PDF and office documents.
